<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET - INDIA 72-5 VS SOUTH AFRICA AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - INDIA 72-5 VS SOUTH AFRICA AT LUNCH.</headline>
<text>
<p>DURBAN, Dec 27 (Reuter) India, in reply to South Africa's first innings of 235, were 72 for five at lunch on the second day of the first test at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
